{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39938","headline":"温陵残腊书怀寄崔尚书 · 徐夤","name":"温陵残腊书怀寄崔尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济川无楫拟何爲，三杰还从汉祖推。\n心学庭槐空发火，鬓同门柳即垂丝。\n中兴未遇先怀策，除夜相催也课[诗]。\n江上年年接君子，一杯春酒一枰棊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}